OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans to benefit from new #900k
OL,4,Asupport service
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new facility offering face-to-face
OL,7,Fadvice, guidance and support for armed
OL,8,Fforces veterans will be built in Dover.
OL,10,FThe government has committed #896,353
OL,11,Fto support the development of a new
OL,12,FVALOUR-recognised centre in the town.
OL,14,FVALOUR is a UK-wide organisation
OL,15,Fdesigned to ensure veterans and their
OL,16,Ffamilies are able to access the help
OL,17,Fthey need.
OL,19,FThe centre in Dover will offer housing
OL,20,Fsupport, health and wellbeing advice,
OL,21,Femployment and training opportunities
OL,22,Fand financial guidance.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
